  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skattemyndigheter: kapacitetsutveckling, fas 2 Skatteverket</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Administrations: capacity development, phase 2, Swedish Tax Authority</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r den andra fasen i ett projekt som Skatteverket genomf&#xf6;r tillsammans med skattemyndigheter och finansministerier i Bosninen-Hercegovina (BiH). Den f&#xf6;rsta fasen genomf&#xf6;rdes 2017-2021. Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten inom de deltagande institutionerna f&#xf6;r att bidra till moderna, p&#xe5;litliga och hj&#xe4;lpsamma skattemyndigheter i BiH. I f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngningen syftar projektet till att f&#xf6;rbereda BiH p&#xe5; reformer inom skattesystemet och dess institutioner f&#xf6;r att landet ska n&#xe4;rma EU-medlemskap. Projektet arbetar inom en rad olika omr&#xe5;den d&#xe4;r experter fr&#xe5;n svenska Skatteverket utbildar och utbyter erfarenheter med kollegor fr&#xe5;n motsvarande bosniska myndigheter. En viktig aspekt av projektet handlar om att skapa kontaktytor mellan myndigheterna och institutionerna i BiH f&#xf6;r att de ska utbyta information och samarbeta mer och b&#xe4;ttre. Det beh&#xf6;vs f&#xf6;r att samordna skattesystemen i landet, vilket &#xe4;r en f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r EU-medlemskap. De omr&#xe5;den som projetket arbetar med handlar om allt fr&#xe5;n att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra service och attityder gentemot brukare/skattebetalare till mer tekniska omr&#xe5;den som f&#xf6;rifyllda deklarationer och internationellt samarbete p&#xe5; skatteomr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is the second phase in a project that the Swedish Tax Agency (STA) is implementing together with the tax authorities and finance ministries in Bosnia-Herzegovina (BiH). The first phase was completed in 2017-2021. The overall objective of the project is to strengthen the capacity within the participating institutions to contribute to modern, trustworthy and helpful tax administrations in BiH. In the long run, the project aims to prepare BiH for reforms within the tax system and its institutions in order for the country to approach EU membership. The project works in a number of different areas where experts from STA train and exchange experiences with colleagues from corresponding BiH authorities. An important aspect of the project is creating contacts between authorities and institutions in BiH in order for them to exchange information and collaborate more and better. This is crucial to harmonize the tax systems in the country, which is a prerequisite for EU membership. The areas within the project works are ranging from improving service and attitudes towards taxpayers to more technical areas such as pre-filled declarations and international cooperation in the area of taxation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Administrations in BiH have improved capacity and have started to transform
into modern, trustworthy and helpful tax administrations.
To achieve the objectives, there are some assumptions made about the
resources from the BiH Tax Administrations:
Relevant counterparts for the STA are available
There is enough time allocated for the staff from the BiH Tax Administrations to
attend missions/workshops and to do the work needed in between missions.
Support and relevant decisions made by top and middle management when
needed
Close cooperation between the BiH Tax Administrations and STA staff</narrative>
  </description>
